  sprites:
  - {fileID: 8637655934773885371, guid: 8748b879a5d70d34ba5dde8ab0c929ce, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 8637655934773885371, guid: 8748b879a5d70d34ba5dde8ab0c929ce, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 8637655934773885371, guid: 8748b879a5d70d34ba5dde8ab0c929ce, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 8637655934773885371, guid: 8748b879a5d70d34ba5dde8ab0c929ce, type: 3}
  paragraphs:
  - "AURORA: Tell me Cos, I\u2019ve always wondered why you never stick with the
    same ship, you\u2019re always changing. Most pilots of your age have their go-to
    by now. "
  - "COSMO: You\u2019re right I don\u2019t have a preference. They just put me in
    the newest models, and I go along with it. It's the man not the machine that
    makes the pilot."
  - 'AURORA: I guess that makes sense, makes you adaptable no matter what ship you
    fly.'
  - 'COSMO: You never know, could come in handy one day knowing how to operate all
    these ships. '
